			"notes": "## OneAddons 3.6\n\nThis update brings OneAddons up to date for **Minecraft 26.2**.\n\n### What's new\n- Updated the mod so it works with Minecraft 26.2 (it was on 26.1.2 before).\n- Updated Fabric Loader, Fabric API, Kotlin, and Odin to the newest versions that support 26.2.\n- Fixed parts of the code that Minecraft and Odin changed, so everything still works the same way:\n  - How the game keeps track of the screen that is open.\n  - How colored glass items are named.\n  - How the mod's settings (number sliders and dropdowns) are created.\n- Updated the build tools (Gradle) to a newer version.\n\n### Download\n- **OneAddons-3.6.jar** — drop this in your `mods` folder.\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft 26.2\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.5 or newer\n- Fabric API 0.161.0+26.2 or newer\n- Fabric Language Kotlin 1.14.2 (kotlin 2.4.21)\n- Odin 0.3.6 or newer\n- Java 25 or newer\n\n### Notes\n- The old Minecraft 26.1.2 code is saved on the `port/26.1.2` branch.\n- All the same modules are included: Auto Experiment, Auto Jump, Chest Assist, Key Maker, Mushroom, Place On Position, Swap Assist, and Toggle Key."
		},
