			"notes": "## What's New\n\n### Auto Jump Module\nAutomatically jumps when colliding with a one-block-high obstacle while moving forward.\n\n**Features:**\n- Detects 1-block obstacles in front of the player while moving forward\n- Configurable jump delay (0-10 ticks)\n- Safety checks: only activates on ground, when moving forward, and when there's space above\n- Clean disable logic to prevent stuck keys\n\n---\n\n**Full Changelog:** https://github.com/1M7md-CS/one-addons/compare/v3.2...v3.3"
		},
